:"10-013-140-1-004","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-1-p1","quote":"建置長輩托老園區","reason":"主張建置長輩托老園區","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":192},{"end":212,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:1","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.commercial-districts"]},"id":"10-013-140-1-005","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-1-p1","quote":"竹田驛園形象商圈","reason":"主張以竹田驛園打造形象商圈；原文沒有寫出做法，工具寫 -；同句的慢城觀光與聚落文化另列主張","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":204},{"end":219,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:1","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tourism"]},"id":"10-013-140-1-006","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-1-p1","quote":"慢城文化觀光","reason":"主張推動慢城文化觀光；原文沒有寫出做法，工具寫 -","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":213},{"end":231,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:1","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.cultural-heritage"]},"id":"10-013-140-1-007","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-1-p1","quote":"客家及閩南聚落文化保存","reason":"主張保存客家與閩南聚落的文化；原文沒有寫出做法，工具寫 -","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":220},{"end":28,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:2","fields":{"action":["action.improve"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.public-space"]},"id":"10-013-140-2-001","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-2-p1","quote":"竭力爭取整合各級行政資源，努力建設、改善竹田公共設施","reason":"主張整合各級政府資源建設與改善竹田的公共設施；比照改善公共設施的既有寫法，對象寫公園與公共空間；第 2 項是施政態度，不建立主張；參選人不是現任者，現任政府計畫寫否","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":2},{"end":97,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:2","fields":{"action":["action.improve"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.farmers"],"condition":[],"funding":["funding.government-budget"],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.river-restoration","target.farm-production-facilities"]},"id":"10-013-140-2-002","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-2-p1","quote":"積極爭取中央經費，致力龍頸溪與各村水路疏濬工程，提升灌溉功能，確保雨季排水順暢","reason":"主張爭取中央經費疏濬龍頸溪與各村水路，提升灌溉並確保排水；查不到主辦機關，龍頸溪不是中央管河川，疏濬由地方爭取經費辦理，主體寫地方政府；經費來自中央，財源寫政府預算；疏濬與灌溉兩個面向各半","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":58},{"end":113,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:2","fields":{"action":["action.add"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.transport-infrastructure"]},"id":"10-013-140-2-003","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-2-p1","quote":"積極開發竹田周邊聯外道路","reason":"主張開闢竹田周邊的聯外道路；查不到道路的等級，依地方道路主體寫地方政府；「提供鄉民方便順暢的交通網」是目的","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":101},{"end":153,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:2","fields":{"action":["action.expand"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.disadvantaged-families","beneficiary.elderly"],"condition":["condition.means-test","condition.family-status"],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.social-assistance"]},"id":"10-013-140-2-004","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-2-p1","quote":"積極為中、低收入戶、獨居長者、弱勢族群爭取福利","reason":"主張為中低收入戶、獨居長者與弱勢族群爭取福利；中低收入與獨居是適用條件；原文沒有寫出措施，工具寫 -","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":130},{"end":183,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:2","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.farmers"],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":["schedule.periodic"],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.agri-marketing","target.tourism"]},"id":"10-013-140-2-005","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-2-p1","quote":"致力推廣本鄉各季農產品，定期舉辦活動，結合行銷與觀光","reason":"主張定期舉辦活動推廣鄉內各季農產品，結合行銷與觀光；農產行銷與觀光兩個面向各半；「促進竹田繁榮」是目標","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":157},{"end":217,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140:2","fields":{"action":["action.integrate"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":["schedule.periodic"],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.lifelong-learning"]},"id":"10-013-140-2-006","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-140-2-p1","quote":"整合圖書館與活動中心空間功能，定期舉辦課程講座","reason":"主張整合圖書館與活動中心的空間，定期舉辦課程講座；「提升鄉親人文素養」是目標","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":194}],"manifest":{"data_version":"fde5dc2be97d","election":"2022-township-mayor","format":"policy-atlas-dataset-scope","format_version":1,"scope":"2022-township-mayor:10-013-140"},"mappings":[{"allocation":0.5,"claim":"10-013-140-1-001","evidence":"開闢城鄉街道，結合地方產業、農產、美食、伴手禮共同展售推廣窗口","facet":"regional.urban.commercial-districts","id":"10-013-140-1-001-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.regional.urban.commercial-districts","question_version":1,"reason":"原文提出投入資源振興地方商圈的具體做法，判為強烈支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.strongly-support","stance_value":2.0},{"allocation":0.5,"claim":"10-013-140-1-001","evidence":"開闢城鄉街道，結合地方產業、農產、美食、伴手禮共同展售推廣窗口","facet":"regional.agriculture.marketing","id":"10-013-140-1-001-m2","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.regional.agriculture.marketing","question_version":1,"reason":"原文寫出農產品的品牌、加工、冷鏈、市集、展售、電商、產銷制度或行銷